---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Project Binary Coffee" windowTitle="web project" showCloseBtn={true}>
  <div class="projectWindow">
    <div class="lg-8 lg-offset-2" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="textbox jc">
        <h2>Project Binary Coffee</h2>
        <p>For this project, I had the privilege of coding a single-page static HTML site designed by an agency. It was a
          challenging and rewarding experience to bring the agency's vision to life through coding, and I am proud to have
          delivered a site that met their expectations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-8" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="bitFilter" >
        <img  class="lazy" src="/media/small/binary-desktop-1920.webp" data-hiResImg="/media/projects/binary-desktop-1920.webp" alt="">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-10 lg-offset-1" data-inView="slideInUp">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <video playsinline loop autoplay muted data-lazyVideo>
          <source src="/media/projects/binary-desktop.mp4" type='video/mp4' />
        </video>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-7" data-inView="slideInUp">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <img  class="lazy" src="/media/small/binary-ipad-and-iphone-potrait.png" data-hiResImg="/media/projects/binary-ipad-and-iphone-potrait.webp" alt="">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-5" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="textbox jc">
        <p>Working on a single-page site presented a unique set of challenges, such as ensuring that the design elements and
        content are well-organized and optimized for fast loading times. I worked closely with the agency to ensure that their
        design was accurately reflected in the final product, and the end result was a seamless user experience that showcased
        the client's brand and message.</p>
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="lg-6" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="textbox jc">
        <p>As part of a dynamic team, I had the opportunity to work on a cutting-edge ordering web app for a coffee shop. My
        role was to focus on the front-end development, ensuring that the user interface was intuitive and visually engaging.</p>
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="lg-6" data-inView="slideInUp">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <video playsinline loop autoplay muted data-lazyVideo>
          <source src="/media/projects/binary-Order.mp4" type='video/mp4' />
        </video>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
